// expect: 0
// A labeled argument keeps its parameter's slot, so the pipe fills the slot
// the label left open: `10 |> minus(b = 3)` is minus(10, 3), which is 7. The
// pin before this landing dropped the open slot and answered minus(3, 10).
fn minus(a, b) = a - b

fn main() = (10 |> minus(b = 3)) - 7
